# Daretti, Rocketeer Engineer: "Whenever Daretti enters or attacks, choose target artifact card in your graveyard. You may sacrifice an
# artifact. If you do, return the chosen card to the battlefield." (CR 603.3d, 608.2d). Turn 1 Bot1 sacrifices a Black Lotus for mana
# and casts Daretti; entering, he targets the Lotus and Bot1 declines the sacrifice: it stays in the graveyard. On turn 3 he attacks, the
# second trigger targets it again, Bot1 sacrifices Mox Pearl this time and the Lotus returns to the battlefield.

